  (text "Potatokid ESP32-S3 sensor hub - schematic draft v1" (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14cd8553-b41e-5ea6-aa45-8ed452ebcff2"))
  (text "Source: esp_devices/README.md; module pinout from seller photos." (at 20 256.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce636844-c751-5189-b3e7-cc75919f8f35"))
  (text "All module VCC/GND follow the README: OLED/INMP441/PIR/433 -> 3V3, MAX98357 VIN -> 5V." (at 20 261 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c3d9709c-cda6-5dee-81c9-19075c9d1db6"))
  (text "MAX98357 SD must be tied to 3V3 (module has internal pull-down). GAIN left open = 9dB." (at 20 265.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf773422-473a-57e9-9427-2d3ea983eb75"))
  (text "INMP441 L/R tied to GND (left channel). Speaker is BTL differential: never tie either terminal to GND." (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "03af51ad-779f-5928-bf7b-d700ce8b45bb"))
  (text "Buttons are active-low with INPUT_PULLUP: pressed = 0V. Do not feed 5V into any GPIO." (at 20 274.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "926f7e70-a629-5072-9318-a59340165bd5"))
  (text "PIR_OUT is intentionally unassigned: GPIO7 is button slot 4. Pick a free RTC GPIO (0-21) in JLCEDA." (at 20 279 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5ee786b7-72b4-57fb-bbb7-1a1fa53fc4f4"))
  (text "Capacitors C1-C4 are optional; modules already have on-board decoupling." (at 20 283.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be1b054f-9514-599e-b83e-679e2be0df87"))
  (text "Before PCB: assign footprints, run ERC, and verify the board header pin order against your physical board." (at 20 288 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed964c58-05df-5534-8902-bd4b4cf83fc3"))
